<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Royal Dutch/Shell begun.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Royal Dutch/Shell begun.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said on Friday  it initiated coverage of Royal Dutch/Shell Transport Group with a  buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The ADR shares trading in New York was down 1-11/16 to 54-1/4.</p>
<p>	  ((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
